Error [E0712]: this `#Grant` region uses the effect `FS, IO`, which it has no capability for
  --> tests/ui/grant_out_of_set.jet:4:18
    |
  4 |     #Grant(caps: Net) {
    |                  ^^^^
 Why: `#Grant(…)` grants only `Net`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — needs a capability in scope to perform it
 Fix: add `FS, IO` to the `#Grant(…)` list, or move that work outside the grant
